                                "sense_id": "a8d5ba47-cf07-3019-90bf-8d16cbee0112",
                                "text": "Whenever any menstruum or other additament is employed, together with the fire, to obtain a sulphur or a salt from a body, we may well take the freedom to examine, whether or no the menstruum do barely help to separate the principle obtained by it..."
                            },
                            {
